&lt;h2 id="overview">Overview
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>I am a &lt;strong>Fresher Full-stack&lt;/strong> with a passion for Backend development and DevOps. I am eager to apply my university knowledge to real-world development challenges and contribute effectively to assigned projects. With a strong interest in backend technologies, my long-term goal is to leverage this foundation to transition into a &lt;strong>DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong> or &lt;strong>Systems Architect&lt;/strong> role in the future.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>I have accumulated proven full-stack web development experience with successful project delivery, modern workflows, and production-ready deployments.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="work-experience">Work Experience
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="freelance-web-developer">Freelance Web Developer
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Position:&lt;/strong> Full-stack Developer | &lt;strong>March 2025 - Present&lt;/strong> | &lt;strong>Remote&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Built and deployed full-stack web projects using &lt;strong>Spring Boot&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>NestJS&lt;/strong> and &lt;strong>Next.js&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>React&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Handled client requirements, pricing, and deployment on server environments&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Successfully delivered more than 3 client projects and improved deployment efficiency through Docker and Nginx&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="intern-web-developer">Intern Web Developer
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Position:&lt;/strong> Full-stack Developer Intern | &lt;strong>October 2024 - February 2025&lt;/strong> | &lt;strong>Company Internship&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Built web interfaces and &lt;strong>RESTful APIs&lt;/strong> using &lt;strong>Spring Boot&lt;/strong> and &lt;strong>Next.js&lt;/strong> within the Scrum workflow and microservices architecture&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Contributed to system analysis, CI/CD optimization, infrastructure deployment using IaC, and team collaboration with Git/GitHub&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="notable-projects">Notable Projects
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="devops-blog">DevOps Blog
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Role:&lt;/strong> Full-stack Developer &amp;amp; Content Creator | &lt;strong>February 2025 - Present&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Built a static site blog using modern static site generator focused on &lt;strong>DevOps&lt;/strong>, Docker optimization, and cloud infrastructure topics&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Published technical articles covering Docker optimization techniques, Nginx configuration, CI/CD workflows, and best practices for containerized applications&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Deployed and maintained production site with custom domain, automated build pipelines, and content management workflows&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://tech.nguuyen.io.vn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Visit Blog&lt;/a> | &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/HoangDuonng/Blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>GitHub Repository&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="tourism-digitalization-platform-360-virtual-travel">Tourism Digitalization Platform (360° Virtual Travel)
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Role:&lt;/strong> Full-stack Developer - Graduation Thesis | &lt;strong>May 2025 - August 2025&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Built a microservices-based tourism platform (&lt;strong>Spring Boot&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>Node.js&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>Python/Flask&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>Next.js&lt;/strong>) for managing interactive 360° virtual destinations&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Designed a &lt;strong>Docker Compose&lt;/strong> infrastructure with &lt;strong>Kong Gateway&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>RabbitMQ&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>PostgreSQL/MongoDB&lt;/strong>, and separate client/admin Next.js frontends&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Implemented secure API routing (JWT, rate limiting, logging) and media pipelines for uploading, extracting, and serving 360° assets&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/HoangDuonng/graduation-project-overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>GitHub Repository&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="online-testing-platform-irt-cat">Online Testing Platform (IRT-CAT)
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Role:&lt;/strong> Full-stack Developer - Team of 5 | &lt;strong>April 2025 - July 2025&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Built an adaptive testing platform using the &lt;strong>3PL-IRT&lt;/strong> model and &lt;strong>CAT&lt;/strong>, including backend modules for students/exams/question banks with per-item difficulty parameters and an automated 3PL-IRT scoring pipeline&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>&lt;a class="link" href="https://ued-smart.education.vnu.edu.vn" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Live Demo&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="document-conversion--ocr-system">Document Conversion &amp;amp; OCR System
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Role:&lt;/strong> DevOps Support / Full-stack Developer - Team of 6 | &lt;strong>October 2024 - February 2025&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Created an OCR-based document processing system (PDF → DOCX, ID extraction) with real-time processing&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Achieved over &lt;strong>98%&lt;/strong> text recognition accuracy and reduced processing time by &lt;strong>60%&lt;/strong> with a microservices architecture&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Contributed to deployment on &lt;strong>Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong> using an IaC approach with &lt;strong>Terraform&lt;/strong> and CI/CD pipelines via GitHub and Jenkins&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Collaborated with a teammate to set up container orchestration and production deployment using &lt;strong>Helm&lt;/strong> and &lt;strong>Kubernetes&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
